s you're ready.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"hermin","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_12","text":"The Ark...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_13","text":"After we arrive, you will be given a thorough medical examination, as well as any treatment which you require.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_14","text":"Once your condition is stabilized, an investigation will take place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_15","text":"I will personally oversee the entire process, and I promise that no physical or psychological harm will come to you during said investigation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_16","text":"If you wish, I will also arrange for additional supplies of Evergreen and secure a residence for you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"hermin","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_17","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_18","text":"Isn't she promising more than she can offer?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_19","text":"No, that's all definitely doable. Triangle has more pull than you think.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_20","text":"I had no idea! I thought she was just a government grunt who liked being a maid on the side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_21","text":"Everyone here can vouch for me and what I'm telling you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_22","text":"So, come with me. Please.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"hermin","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_23","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"hermin","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_24","text":"I...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_25","text":"Please let me know if there's anything else you would like.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"hermin","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_26","text":"I... I'm afraid I don't have much faith in the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_27","text":"Excuse me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"hermin","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_28","text":"The Ark abandoned us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"hermin","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_29","text":"They praised us to the skies. Used us as a symbol of resistance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"hermin","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_30","text":"They promised to come save us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"hermin","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_31","text":"But when we were out here dying, they abandoned us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"hermin","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_32","text":"You have no idea how much hope we had.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"hermin","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_33","text":"We hoped that one day, the Ark would come to save us. That they hadn't forgotten about us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"hermin","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_34","text":"That's how I survived for decades.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"hermin","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_intermission_01_35","text":"Have you all come here to save me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_intermission_01_36",